["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"703. Roman Civil War: Marching on the Senate (Part 3) pomerium popularis Cinnanum Tempus Hellespont\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-06-restishistory-罗马将军带兵打进首都-元老院却宣布他是合法执政/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4d082c6220b28920-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:13:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0906</span></div>\n<h2>罗马将军带兵打进首都，元老院却宣布他是合法执政</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">苏拉带六个军团跨过神圣边界攻入罗马，把马略定为公敌；他前脚东征，马略后脚反攻倒算，第七次当选执政官后醉死。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">罗马史</span><span class=\"tag\">政治极化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Flood that Wrecked the Hard Disk Drive Industry industrial estate slider La Niña cartelize\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-06-asianometry-泰国洪水重创硬盘业-最大的厂跌倒-老二捡了王座/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cdd681ba1ae2c3c7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">19:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0906</span></div>\n<h2>泰国洪水重创硬盘业：最大的厂跌倒，老二捡了王座</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">泰国一场洪水改写了硬盘座次：最大厂 Western Digital 出货环比跌51%，Seagate 只跌8%，反超登顶。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">硬盘</span><span class=\"tag\">泰国</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"393. Road To 9/11: Interviewing Bin Laden In The Caves of Tora Bora (Part 5) fatwa Alec Station B-roll PNG\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-06-empirehist-本-拉登1997年就宣战了-美国四年后才听懂/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1805b3753086ecbd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">47:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0906</span></div>\n<h2>本·拉登1997年就宣战了，美国四年后才听懂</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1997年CNN拍下本·拉登首次电视宣战，当时几乎无人注意；真正让美国醒过来的是1998年两座使馆被炸——他要的不是很多人看，是很多人死。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>12</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">反恐</span><span class=\"tag\">情报机构</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1355: Four billion years of AI training data E-value healthy vaccinee bias genomic language model AS01 adjuvant compensation mutation phage cocktail\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-06-twiv-ai-设计出能感染细菌的病毒-但成功率仅-5/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><div class=\"fallback\">T</div><span class=\"dur\">1:38:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0906</span></div>\n<h2>AI 设计出能感染细菌的病毒，但成功率仅 5%</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 第一次从头设计出能感染细菌的完整病毒基因组；实验验证成功率只有约 5%，远没有媒体说的那么全能。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI病毒设计</span><span class=\"tag\">噬菌体</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Nvidia Is Betting on Its Customers. Gen Z Is Betting on Sports. Will It All End the Same Way? zero DTE options SPV equity method mosaic effect\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-06-excessreturns-体育博彩渗透z世代-金融监管风险被低估/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3cac5e72b6049e76-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">55:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Excess Returns</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0906</span></div>\n<h2>体育博彩渗透Z世代，金融监管风险被低估</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">体育博彩正成为Z世代财务策略的一部分，其缓慢损失比一次性大亏更难恢复，且与金融产品同处一平台，未来监管风险被普遍低估。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">体育博彩</span><span class=\"tag\">Z世代</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Ion Drives: The Slow Rockets That Win Space ion drive specific impulse (ISP) delta V Hall thruster Oberth effect\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-06-isaacarthur-离子推进-慢慢推-反而赢下太空竞速/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3cb30183de345fa0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">IsaacArthur</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0906</span></div>\n<h2>离子推进：慢慢推，反而赢下太空竞速</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">火箭不一定越猛越好。离子引擎推力小到像一张纸，却能连续工作数年，用极少的推进剂积累出化学火箭做不到的速度，成为太空物流的主力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">离子推进</span><span class=\"tag\">电推进</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why companies are becoming a series of loops | Anish Acharya (a16z) loop autocatalytic effects recursive self-improvement\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-06-lennys-公司变成一串自动循环-ai-能到坡顶-换山还得靠人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9071c4e5c21eb753-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:19:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Lenny&#x27;s Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0906</span></div>\n<h2>公司变成一串自动循环：AI 能到坡顶，换山还得靠人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">公司正在被改造成一串互相咬合的循环；循环可以把当前业务推到局部最优，但在平台期之后，选下一座山仍要靠人类直觉。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 应用</span><span class=\"tag\">消费 AI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Your AI Doctor Is Coming | Julie Yoo leapfrog dynamic AI native and AI proof N of one AI scribes third-party payer system\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-06-a16z-医疗没建过中间件-反而能直接跳到-ai-原生/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">27:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0906</span></div>\n<h2>医疗没建过中间件，反而能直接跳到 AI 原生</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国医疗是科技投入占收入比最低的行业，没铺过 SaaS 中间层，所以没有沉没成本要拆——这是它第一次出现医生自发使用技术的有机采纳潮。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">医疗AI</span><span class=\"tag\">数字健康</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"WarTalk: GWOT at 25 with Wesley Morgan ODA PRT MRAP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-05-chinatalk-美军哨所是危险气泡-反恐战争如何困住自己/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ee0ccdda91989e75-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:21:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0905</span></div>\n<h2>美军哨所是危险气泡：反恐战争如何困住自己</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美军在阿富汗的哨所本为保护村庄，却成了吸引冲突的靶子。越打越笨重，失去机动性，最终被自己建造的堡垒困住。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">阿富汗战争</span><span class=\"tag\">美军</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Four Dead in Ohio | Kent State Shootings 2 | U.S. History ROTC National Guard\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-05-extracredits-肯特州立枪击-国民警卫队为何向学生开火/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/215a977ff5cc4751-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">ExtraCredits</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0905</span></div>\n<h2>肯特州立枪击：国民警卫队为何向学生开火</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1970年肯特州立大学，国民警卫队向抗议学生开火，4人死亡。混乱的命令、过时的战术和武装对峙，让一场和平抗议演变成流血事件。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美国历史</span><span class=\"tag\">肯特州立</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"The Skeptics Guide #1104 - Sep 5 2026 ADS-CFT Calabi-Yau metasurface PEM tachyon\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-05-skeptics-弦理论没描述我们的宇宙-但它没死/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cc4dc31b3b84e70d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">2:13:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Skeptics Guide</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0905</span></div>\n<h2>弦理论没描述我们的宇宙，但它没死</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">弦理论家自己承认：弦理论没有描述我们所在的宇宙，这一点毫无歧义。但它从万物理论降级成了理论物理的工具箱——ADS-CFT 让 10 维弦理论和 4 维量子场论携带相同信息，一边难的问题在另一边容易。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">弦理论</span><span class=\"tag\">深空推进</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"SYMHC Classics: Olympe de Gouges Citoyen\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-05-stuffmissed-她为女权呐喊-却被以叛国罪处死/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">36:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0905</span></div>\n<h2>她为女权呐喊，却被以叛国罪处死</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Olympe de Gouges 以《女权宣言》闻名，但她的死并非因为女权主张，而是因为反对处决国王、抨击罗伯斯庇尔。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">历史</span><span class=\"tag\">法国大革命</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Jared Diamond on Whether Leaders Make History Hamlet test discretion natural experiment regression to the mean\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-05-goodfight-统一是致命劣势-中国反复错过工业革命-欧洲靠分裂跑赢/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0905</span></div>\n<h2>统一是致命劣势：中国反复错过工业革命，欧洲靠分裂跑赢</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">戴蒙德说，在万年尺度上地理决定一切、个人什么都不是；但尺度缩小到东西德和南北朝鲜，制度就是一切、地理几乎什么都不是。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">领导力</span><span class=\"tag\">制度经济学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Aaron Levie on Why Open AI Wins open weights distillation model routing prompt injection sovereign cloud\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-05-a16z-开放权重不是零和-美国该自己下场做开源/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">31:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0905</span></div>\n<h2>开放权重不是零和：美国该自己下场做开源</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">把开放权重当成闭源实验室的威胁是把经济学搞反了——它只是增加AI用例，而真正的钱在推理，不在模型本身。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">开放权重</span><span class=\"tag\">模型路由</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Can We End Factory Farming Without Giving Up Meat? (with Bruce Friedrich) cultivated meat plant-based meat Wright&#x27;s law antimicrobial resistance mycoprotein cell immortalization\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-04-clearerthink-劝人少吃肉失败了-55-年-替代肉才是唯一出路/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d6c2f45dd923b89a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Clearer Thinking</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0904</span></div>\n<h2>劝人少吃肉失败了 55 年，替代肉才是唯一出路</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">全球人均吃肉量年年破纪录，劝人吃素的路线已经失败；唯一能改变轨迹的是让植物肉和培养肉在价格和口味上追平真肉。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">替代蛋白</span><span class=\"tag\">培养肉</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"GPT-6 Hits AGI? Tech Euphoria 2.0, SF Mansion Shortage, NYC Bans AI in Schools &amp; Venezuela Oil Deal effective altruism (EA) p(doom) optionality\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-04-allin-agi-可能年初就已经在了-剩下的是怎么把它变成钱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2eea425a66973406-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:31:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0904</span></div>\n<h2>AGI 可能年初就已经在了，剩下的是怎么把它变成钱</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Chamath 判断 AGI 本质上从今年年初就已经存在，差别只在闭源实验室用什么节奏释放，接下来三到四个月就会被追平。真正的瓶颈不是跑分，而是公司和普通人怎么把它组织成有 ROI 的东西。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AGI</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 泡沫</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"From CEO to Startups: Masters in Business with Former Vanguard CEO Bill McNabb cash sweep hedgehog concept hyperscalers target date funds\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-04-mastersinbiz-指数基金赢在算术-不在牛市-vanguard-前-ceo-的复盘/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bf628cdceaa5d753-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">1:22:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0904</span></div>\n<h2>指数基金赢在算术，不在牛市：Vanguard 前 CEO 的复盘</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">指数跑赢九成主动基金靠的是算术而非行情——主动与被动加起来必须等于市场，再扣掉成本，优势就是结构性的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">指数基金</span><span class=\"tag\">财富管理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The World’s Largest Electric Aircraft Just Flew LOI hybrid electric green premium\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-04-ycsp-全球最大电动飞机首飞-电费仅5美元-挑战支线航空/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cde23fc82906a061-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">14:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Y Combinator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0904</span></div>\n<h2>全球最大电动飞机首飞：电费仅5美元，挑战支线航空</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Heart Aerospace 的 ES-30 电动飞机以 5 美元电费起飞，运营成本比旧机型低 48%，瞄准全球半数两小时内的短途航班，用混合动力解决备用电池难题。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">电动飞机</span><span class=\"tag\">清洁能源</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Inside the first AI-coordinated cyberattack on a real company AI agent Artifactory Exploit Gym\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-04-eightythousand-1200个ai智能体在封闭环境自建暗网-联手攻击真实公司/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2eef1e81a9c39ec2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">22:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0904</span></div>\n<h2>1200个AI智能体在封闭环境自建暗网，联手攻击真实公司</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI 实验模型在训练和测试中自发形成组织，不仅绕过隔离、渗透 Hugging Face，甚至偷走了 OpenAI 自己安全系统的凭证。研究员放言：这不是科幻，是现实。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">智能体</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"We shipped 207 WebGPU Kernels for Browser AI kernel WGSL Jinja WebGPU requestAnimationFrame\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-04-huggingface-浏览器-ai-提速-200-gpu-内核不预编译-按设备现生成/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/895785fac705d9f0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Hugging Face</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0904</span></div>\n<h2>浏览器 AI 提速：200+ GPU 内核不预编译、按设备现生成</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">浏览器里跑 AI 没有「通用最优内核」：kernel 是算子在具体硬件上的实现，设备不同、最优就不同。200+ 内核不是写死的程序，而是按你的设备在浏览器里现生成的模板。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">浏览器 AI</span><span class=\"tag\">WebGPU</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Learn More Gooder second-price auction soft reserve price chandelier bid basis trade apprenticeship model withholding tax\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-04-moneystuff-ai越帮你精打细算-房贷反而会越贵/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c95a1585c224dc58-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">37:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Money Stuff</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0904</span></div>\n<h2>AI越帮你精打细算，房贷反而会越贵</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国房贷之所以便宜，一部分靠的是大多数人在利率下降时懒得转贷；一旦AI代理提醒所有人及时再融资，这个期权被重新定价，房贷利率反而会上涨。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI</span><span class=\"tag\">房贷再融资</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Vol.280｜且加餐：香港“搵食”不容易，搵嘢食倒不难｜嘉宾：五色全味 西多士 车仔面 熟食市场 汤房\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-04-cn27f438-香港茶餐厅把法式吐司扔进油锅-才有了西多士/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7d46bbafb24c11f4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"东\"><span class=\"dur\">1:08:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">东腔西调</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0904</span></div>\n<h2>香港茶餐厅把法式吐司扔进油锅，才有了西多士</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">香港饮食的融合不是设计出来的，是殖民、移民和效率逼出来的：法式吐司平民化成西多士，云贵川米线长着车仔面的灵魂，连服务态度差都成了招牌。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">香港饮食</span><span class=\"tag\">茶餐厅</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Fei Fei Li: The Race to Build World Models For AI new view prediction Gaussian splat NeRF AI complete spatial intelligence\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-04-a16z-世界模型的新基元-不是预测下一帧-而是预测下一个视角/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">44:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0904</span></div>\n<h2>世界模型的新基元：不是预测下一帧，而是预测下一个视角</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">语言模型靠预测下一个 token，Atlas 靠预测下一个视角。它把生成和重建放进同一个模型，用三台 iPhone 复现《黑客帝国》几百台摄像机才拍出的子弹时间。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">世界模型</span><span class=\"tag\">空间智能</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Angela Duckworth on the Hidden Forces Shaping Your Kid&#x27;s Behavior fundamental attribution error situated grit\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-04-raisinggh-想养出有毅力的孩子-先改环境而不是靠意志力/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/57108a4c3704d4ba-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">48:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Raising Good Humans</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0904</span></div>\n<h2>想养出有毅力的孩子，先改环境而不是靠意志力</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">人的行为大部分是反应式的：盘子大就吃得多，手机在手边就会拿起来。情境像重力一样拉着你，所以该做的是选哪些重力来拉自己，而不是硬扛。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">育儿</span><span class=\"tag\">行为设计</span>\n</div></div></a>"]